<title>USA: Affinity shareholders to get 7.5 mln Century units.</title>
<headline>Affinity shareholders to get 7.5 mln Century units.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Affinity Entertainment Inc said Wednesday it will distribute, on a pro-rata basis, 7.5 million unregistered units of Century Technologies Inc. as a stock dividend to Affinity's shareholders of record as of July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Affinity said this supersedes and corrects any prior announcements concerning the record date for participation in this dividend.</p>
<p>Each units consists of one share of Century common and a warrant to purchase one share of Century common at $2.00.</p>
<p>Affinity Entertainment Inc. produces full feature films through their wholly owned subsidiary, Affinity Entertainment Group Inc.</p>
</text>
